<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS6.SSS0.Px4" title="In 3.6 Evaluation Protocol and Metrics ‣ 3 BENCHMARK DATASET ‣ OrdinalBench: A Benchmark Dataset for Diagnosing Generalization Limits in Ordinal Number Understanding of Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Trace Coverage (Cov.)</span></a></li>
